\\\nNet: NOT finishable by pushing the current kappa(p) path (it ends in a false statement). Finishable by the bounded kappa(z) pivot (XS + L + M). The math is standard curve geometry (single-point local generation), not new theory.\\\\n\\\\nWorksheet informal/spec-dd4-fieldvanishing.md, commit 4963603d62871a1ed9061212dcb560c0162b2318.\\\",\\n      \\\"scope\\\": {\\n        \\\"projects\\\": [\\n          \\\"Algebraic-Jacobian-Challenge-Rebuild\\\"\\n        ]\\n      },\\n      \\\"audience\\\": \\\"horizon\\\",\\n      \\\"author\\\": \\\"human\\\",\\n      \\\"source_ref\\\": null,\\n      \\\"created_at\\\": \\\"2026-07-20T05:52:01.429527+00:00\\\",\\n      \\\"updated_at\\\": \\\"2026-07-20T05:52:01.429540+00:00\\\",\\n      \\\"comments\\\": [],\\n      \\\"metadata\\\": {\\n        \\\"history\\\": [\\n          {\\n            \\\"at\\\": \\\"2026-07-20T05:52:02.642319+00:00\\\",\\n            \\\"actor\\\": \\\"human\\\",\\n            \\\"field\\\": \\\"created\\\",\\n            \\\"from\\\": \\\"\\\",\\n            \\\"to\\\": \\\"open\\\",\\n            \\\"note\\\": \\\"opened\\\"\\n          }\\n        ]\\n      }\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"id\\\": \\\"I-0304\\\",\\n      \\\"provider\\\": \\\"local\\\",\\n      \\\"kind\\\": \\\"info\\\",\\n      \\\"status\\\": \\\"open\\\",\\n      \\\"labels\\\": [\\n        \\\"agent-ready\\\"\\n      ],\\n      \\\"body\\\": \\\"SEED FINISH: RD-N step 2c stalk-support bridge LANDED (commit 83ed7461); RD-N proper + hfib + certificate + U1 NOT closed \\\\u2014 both remaining walls are XL (achiever fibre-divisibility + hfib achiever wiring), precisely reduced.\\\\n\\\\n=== COMMIT (this lane) ===\\\\n- 83ed7461918b46885bff65762d9151bb95c98b61  DD-4 redesign RD-N step 2c: the stalk support bridge. New file Picard/DivSchemeRedesignSeedFinish.lean (160 L). Single-module LEAN_NUM_THREADS=1 lake build GREEN under the mkdir lock (8790 jobs, 36s). Zero sorries/warnings in my file. Root: HEAD-blob + only my import line