      "body": "**FBC member-node patterns (session 0007-T2) \u2014 the essImage route that closed `IsIso bareBC`.**\n\n- **Specialize the Beck\u2013Chevalley square to `p = V\u2080.\u03b9` (`V\u2080 : X.Opens`, `IsAffineOpen V\u2080`)** instead of an abstract affine open immersion `p : V \u27f6 X`. Every consumer instantiates that form (`coverInterOpen`), and it makes qcoh bookkeeping FREE via iterated `isQuasicoherent_pullback_opens` \u2014 no general 'pullback along open immersion preserves qcoh' needed (that exists only in sorry-tainted `QuotScheme.lean`, do NOT import it).\n- **Prove 'pullback of pushforward is a pushforward' as essImage membership, with the ring square the ABSTRACT pushout** `B := pushout \u03c6 \u03c8` (`IsPushout.of_hasPushout`): geometric cartesianness is free (`isPullback_SpecMap_of_isPushout`), `Spec \u03c3` open-immersion by stability, its range via `IsOpenImmersion.range_pullbackSnd` + `hpb.isoPullback_hom_snd` + `Set.range_eq_univ.mpr h.surjective`, and the final match with the preimage open by `IsOpenImmersion.isoOfRangeEq` + `pushforwardComp/Congr`. NO four-corner isoSpec transport of a concrete square.\n- **`pullback e.hom \u2245 pushforward e.inv`** (scheme iso e): `Adjunction.leftAdjointUniq (pullbackPushforwardAdjunction e.hom) (pushforwardEquivOfIso e).symm.toAdjunction` \u2014 one-liner, no defeq wall.\n- **Open-open pushforward\u2013restriction commutation**: the `glueOverlapBaseChangeIso` 4-step pattern (`SheafOfModules.pushforwardComp \u226a\u226b pushforwardNatIso(eqToIso) \u226a\u226b pushforwardCongr \u226a\u226b pushforwardComp.symm`) transfers verbatim to the square `opensInterLift V\u2080 U \u226b V\u2080.\u03b9 = (U.\u03b9 \u207b\u00b9\u1d41 V\u2080).\u03b9 \u226b U.\u03b9`; the appLE-coherence proof is the same 5 lines.\n- **Pointwise scheme-morphism reasoning**: derive morphism-level equalities first (cancel isos with `cancel_mono`), then apply at points with `Scheme.Hom.comp_apply`; raw `ConcreteCategory.hom`-coercion mismatches from `Set.mem_image` unfold are defeq \u2014 bridge with `have h' : U.\u03b9 y = V\u2080.\u03b9 x := hyx` + `show`.\n- **Names**: `Opens.grothendieckTopology` (root ns), `Scheme.Hom.comp_apply`, `Scheme.Hom.comp_preimage`, `IsAffineOpen.inf` (needs `[IsAffineHom (pullback.diagonal (terminal.from X))]` \u27f8 `IsSeparated.isClosedImmersion_diagonal`), `Scheme.Hom.isAffineOpen_iff_of_isOpenImmersion`, `IsOpenImmersion.of_comp`.\n- The whole 430-LOC file (`Cohomology/AffinePushPullEssImage.lean`) compiled with ~3 error-fix iterations \u2014 the iso-chain compositions (`pushforwardComp/Congr/Id .app` chains) hit NO v4.31 transparency walls.",
