          "body": "**Partial repair (run 0010 T12):** the T12 session added the qcqs section-localization block to `Picard_QuotScheme.tex` (`sec:quot_qcqs_section_localization`, 6 new nodes, all `\\lean`-anchored + `\\leanok`), which **defines** the formerly-dangling `lem:qcoh_section_localization_basicOpen` \u2014 its two consumer crefs (lines ~2352, ~2386) now resolve.\n\nStill open (verified this round \u2014 referenced but no `\\label{}`):\n- `lem:qcoh_affine_isIso_fromTilde\u0393` (2 refs)\n- `lem:qcoh_affine_section_localization` (1 ref)\n- `lem:section_localization_descent` (5 refs)\n- `lem:isLocalizedModule_restrict_of_isIso_fromTilde\u0393` (2 refs)\n\nThe gap1/gap2 union-merge Lean machinery these should document is still blueprint-absent. Keep this item for the next blueprint pass; the new `sec:quot_qcqs_section_localization` block is a good sibling to model the missing nodes on."
