      "body": "Recipes: closing GeometricallyReduced / GeometricallyIrreducible scaffold sorries (v4.31 Mathlib has the full API)\n\nMathlib v4.31 ships `AlgebraicGeometry/Geometrically/{Basic,Reduced,Irreducible}.lean` \u2014 these scaffold instances are now provable, not gaps. Proven patterns (see `Points.lean` `gm_geometricallyReduced`, `ChartIso.lean` `projectiveLineBar_geomIrred`, both axiom-clean):\n\n- **Affine case** (`Spec A \u27f6 Spec k\u0304`): `rw [geometricallyReduced_iff / geometricallyIrreducible_iff]`, intro the `IsPullback`, `obtain \u27e8\u03c6, rfl\u27e9 := Spec.map_surjective y; algebraize [\u03c6.hom]`, then `h.isoPullback \u226a\u226b pullbackSpecIso k\u0304 A K` reduces to `IsReduced/IsDomain (A \u2297[k\u0304] K)`. Needs `set_option backward.isDefEq.respectTransparency false in` (the `(Gm k\u0304).hom`-to-`Spec.map` defeq).\n- **Ring step for localizations**: `IsReduced (Localization.Away t \u2297[k\u0304] K)` via `Algebra.TensorProduct.cancelBaseChange k\u0304 P P _ K` (`\u2245 Loc \u2297[P] (P \u2297[k\u0304] K)`), instance `IsLocalization.tensor`, and `isReduced_localizationPreserves` (apply with `by exact` + explicit S \u2014 beta-reduction quirk). `MvPolynomial.algebraTensorAlgEquiv` + `Algebra.TensorProduct.comm` give `P \u2297[k\u0304] K \u2245 MvPolynomial \u03c3 K`.\n- **Proj / non-affine case** (\u2119\u00b9): cover the base change by pulled-back chart opens. Per chart: `Proj.away\u03b9_toSpecZero_assoc` + `\u2190 Spec.map_comp` + `change` collapses `away\u03b9 \u226b hom` to `Spec.map (algebraMap k\u0304 (Away \ud835\udc9c (X i)))`, then the affine recipe. Covering: `Proj.iSup_basicOpen_eq_top` with the (now named) `projectiveLineBarAffineCover_span`. Intersection: any preimage of the generic point `\u27e8\u22a5, Ideal.isPrime_bot, \u2026\u27e9` under `pullback.fst` (surjective \u2014 `Surjective` is `IsStableUnderBaseChange`, `MorphismProperty.pullback_fst`). Assemble with the new `irreducibleSpace_of_two_irreducible_opens` (ChartIso).\n- **Traps**: inside `namespace AlgebraicGeometry`, ring-level `IsReduced` must be `_root_.IsReduced`; `\u2297[k\u0304]` notation needs `open scoped TensorProduct in` BEFORE the docstring; avoid `ObjectProperty.prop_of_iso _` (leaves an unsynthesizable eta-expanded `IsClosedUnderIsomorphisms` goal \u2014 use `isReduced_of_isOpenImmersion (iso).hom` or `.homeomorph.irreducibleSpace_iff` instead); the affine cover's `I\u2080`/`\ud835\udcb0.f i` are semireducibly opaque \u2014 work with `Proj.away\u03b9 (X i)` + `fin_cases` normalization (`projectiveLineBar_smooth_chart_aux` idiom) rather than cover indices.",
