      "body": "FBC bareBC Stage-2 patterns + scratch-iteration gotchas (session 0003-T2)\n\n**Mate-factorization pattern (landed, reusable for other Beck-Chevalley mates):**\n\n- `mateEquiv adj\u2081 adj\u2082 \u03b1 |>.app c` factors as `adj\u2082.unit.app _ \u226b R\u2082.map (\u03b1.app _) \u226b R\u2082.map (H.map (adj\u2081.counit.app c))`. Proof: `simp [<def>, mateEquiv_apply]` then `erw [Category.id_comp, Category.id_comp, Category.comp_id]; rfl` (three defeq-blocked `\ud835\udfd9`s + one defeq head).\n- Counit of `pullback q \u22a3 pushforward q` at open immersion `q` is iso: `IsIso.of_isIso_fac_left (Adjunction.leftAdjointUniq_hom_app_counit (restrictAdjunction q) (pullbackPushforwardAdjunction q) c)` with `haveI` on `(restrictAdjunction q).counit` iso via `inferInstanceAs (IsIso (restrictFunctorAdjCounitIso q).hom)`.\n- essImage \u2192 unit-iso: `Adjunction.isIso_unit_app_of_iso` (needs `pushforward` Full+Faithful \u2014 Mathlib instances for open immersions). Reverse `mem_essImage_of_unit_isIso`.\n- **essImage of `p'_*` is cover-local** (`essImage_pushforward_of_openCover`, now in `CechHigherDirectImageUnconditional`): site-level `restrictAdjunction` unit has plain `M.presheaf.map homOfLE` components; `isIso_iff_isIso_restrict` + `Hom.isIso_iff_isIso_app` need NO push/pull coherence \u2014 components of the restricted map are again plain presheaf maps; match via `w''(O \u2293 w\u207b\u00b9R) = R \u2293 w''O` (`Set.image_inter_preimage`) + one `eqToHom (congrArg Opposite.op h)` factor. Poset-hom equalities: `congr 1` after `rw [\u2190 Functor.map_comp]` discharges by proof-irrelevance; op-level casts via `Quiver.Hom.unop_inj; Subsingleton.elim`.\n\n**Scratch-iteration gotchas:**\n\n- `lake env lean scratch.lean` does NOT apply lakefile `leanOptions`. Add `set_option maxSynthPendingDepth 3` at scratch top or instance chains through functor categories fail mysteriously (e.g. `IsIso ((leftAdjointUniq ..).hom.app M)` composites). Destination files under `lake build` are fine.\n- Mathlib-only lemmas iterate in ~3 min via a root-level scratch importing `Mathlib` (+ light project modules whose oleans exist) \u2014 20x faster than the project file. Delete scratch before commit.\n- `CechSectionIdentificationLegMid1.lean` takes ~70+ min to compile (`maxHeartbeats 0`, documented in-file); it IS in `CechHigherDirectImageUnconditional`'s import cone (via `CechTermAcyclic \u2192 CechSectionIdentificationBase \u2192 \u2026 `). Full verification of Unconditional edits costs hours if its olean is stale/missing.\n- Beware RACING concurrent lake builds of the same project from leftover/parallel sessions (two `lean` processes on the same file observed) \u2014 olean corruption risk, duplicated 70-min work.",
