      "body": "**Albanese rational-map-extension leg (`ALB.codim1`) is now cleanly gated on a single leaf \u2014 recommended next milestone to run.**\n\nReconcile of run 0006 T6 (verified this session: `lake build` green 8582 jobs; new lemmas `#print axioms` clean; work-review verdict \"converging, no defect\"; blueprint 0 dangling):\n\n- A **false pinned statement** was found and removed (a codim-1-free map to *any* complete target does **not** extend; counterexample $\\mathbb P^2\\dashrightarrow\\mathbb P^1$). It had silently blocked the cone for ~30 iterations and dragged a phantom Stacks-0AVF dependency into the blueprint \u2014 both now gone.\n- The honest chain (Milne 3.1 + empty-locus extension) is proved and axiom-clean; `Thm32RationalMapExtension.lean` is sorry-free.\n- **Only leaf left:** Milne 3.3 (`indeterminacy_pure_codim_one_into_grpScheme`). Discharging it makes the whole Thm 3.2 extension theorem (`extend_to_av`) sorry-free.\n\n**Suggested action:** `horizon run ALB.codim1` \u2014 it is a well-scoped, high-value single-leaf target (multi-session build: difference-map + function-field pullback + pole-divisor machinery). Feeds `ALB.up` (Albanese universal property) and thence `AJC.jacobian`.",
