      "body": "**T12 (FGA Picard representability) is premature \u2014 no high-value single-session win, and T2/FBC should land first.**\n\nOpening-Ground assessment of run 0010 focus `tasks=T12` (roadmap `AJC.picrep`): like T5s \"close the 9 sorries\", the `DONE WHEN FGAPicRepresentability sorry-free` bar is over-optimistic for one session, and the cone is not yet ripe to push. Tree is green (`lake build` 8642 jobs); direction-setting only, no proofs attempted.\n\n**Why it is blocked (verified this session):**\n\n- The 4 `FGAPicRepresentability` stubs are gated on the A.2.b Quot/Hilbert engine (closure order B\u2192C\u2192A). `instHasPicScheme` is the full FGA existence theorem; the blueprint itself says it \"is NOT expected to close in a single session.\"\n- `QuotScheme` (12 sorries) and `FlatteningStratification` (7 sorries) are file-skeletons for **deep Nitsure \u00a74/\u00a75 constructions needing machinery Mathlib v4.31 lacks**: relative $\\mathbb P^n_S$, coherent-sheaf $\\chi$ / Hilbert polynomial, Castelnuovo\u2013Mumford boundedness, Fitting-ideal rank strata + generic freeness, Altman\u2013Kleiman flat-proper equivalence-relation descent. Each is a multi-session build.\n- **The picrep \u03c7 inputs depend on T2 (`AJC.fbc`), which is still open**: `cech_flatBaseChange` (Stacks 02KH) is the intended Hilbert-polynomial-openness engine, but `CechHigherDirectImageUnconditional.lean` still carries **3 leaf sorries** (L196/1646/1712). Until T2 lands, `QuotScheme`s base-change chain has no infrastructure to draw on.\n\n**What a T12 Horizon session can actually achieve (modest):**\n\n- One genuinely-correct leaf: `flatteningStratification.ofCurve` (delegation to the main theorem) \u2014 removes a leaf but not axiom-debt (rests on a still-open sorry).\n- A real-content stretch: the Stacks-01I8 tilde helper `tildeIso_of_isQuasicoherent_isAffineOpen` (substrate `qcoh_iso_tilde_sections` exists, sorry-free), likely spanning >1 session.\n- The two FGA `Nonempty` carriers (`instHasDivFunctor`/`instHasAbelMap`) are **deliberate \"awaiting real definition\" flags** \u2014 closing them with const/zero witnesses is false progress; the Horizon agent has been directed to leave them.\n\n**Recommendation:** consider prioritizing **T2/`AJC.fbc` (3 leaves)** \u2014 and, in parallel, a Route-C Riemann\u2013Roch / coherent-$\\chi$ substrate \u2014 before a full T12 push, since both are hard prerequisites for the Quot engine. If T12 runs now, expect only marginal leaf-count reduction, not a headline advance. (I do not edit tasks; `AJC.picrep` left `active` as guidance, with the full triage recorded as a roadmap comment on `AJC.picrep`.)",
