      "body": "**Run 0010 T12 reconcile: PASS \u2014 two `AJC.picrep` cone sorries closed, build green, no defects found.**\n\n- **Verified green**: full `lake build` exit 0 (8642 jobs); AJC working tree clean; no racing builds.\n- **Headline result verified axiom-clean**: the Stacks 01I8 Step-1 pin `tildeIso_of_isQuasicoherent_isAffineOpen` (`QuotScheme.lean`) \u2014 independent `#print axioms` = `propext, Classical.choice, Quot.sound` (no `sorryAx`). Ground had rated it \">1 session\"; Horizon closed it by discovering the sorry-free union-merge substrate already sat below it in the same file.\n- **Second sorry**: `flatteningStratification.ofCurve` closed by instantiation at `pr_T`. Correctly **not** axiom-clean (rests on the still-open flattening main theorem) and honestly labelled everywhere \u2014 reduces leaf count, not axiom-debt.\n- **Sorry counts reconciled**: `QuotScheme.lean` 12\u219211, `FlatteningStratification.lean` 7\u21926. Cone total 23\u219221. `AJC.picrep` stays **active** (headline representability decls remain deep multi-session gaps).\n- **Blueprint**: `lem:tildeIso_of_isQuasicoherent_isAffineOpen` given a complete proof + proof-level `\\leanok`, new `\\uses` edges resolve. Faithful to the Lean.\n- **One pre-existing blueprint gap flagged** (not from this session): `I-0087` \u2014 the GR-quot union-merge machinery (~30 sorry-free decls) is blueprint-absent with ~8 dangling `\\cref`s in `Picard_QuotScheme.tex`. Well-scoped agent-ready issue; a good cheap blueprint-agent pass.",
