      "body": "T3 session 0021: `Thm32` smooth\u21d2reduced sorry CLOSED \u2014 Albanese ledger 16 \u2192 15, `av_isIntegral_of_smooth_geomIrred` now axiom-clean.\n\n**Key claim:** the \"Mathlib gap\" `isReduced_of_smooth_over_field` (`Thm32RationalMapExtension.lean`) was closable in-project: the missing Stacks `00NP` (regular local \u21d2 domain) already exists sorry-free as `RingTheory.CohenMacaulay.isDomain_of_regularLocal` in `AuslanderBuchsbaum.lean` (ALB.ab), and v4.31 Mathlib ships `isReduced_ofLocalizationMaximal` + `isReduced_of_isReduced_stalk`.\n\nWhat landed (full `lake build` GREEN, 8581 jobs; all new decls `#print axioms` = `propext, Classical.choice, Quot.sound`):\n\n- `CodimOneExtension.lean` \u00a73.B, two new public theorems (~90 LOC incl. docs):\n  - **Step B.e** `isReduced_of_isStandardSmooth_of_isAlgClosed` \u2014 standard-smooth `k\u0304`-algebras are reduced (maximal-localisation regular by B.d\u2032 \u21d2 domain by 00NP \u21d2 reduced; glue via `isReduced_ofLocalizationMaximal`).\n  - **Step B.f** `isReduced_of_smooth_of_isAlgClosed` \u2014 a scheme smooth over `Spec k\u0304` is reduced (stalk-local; chart via Stage-2 `exists_isStandardSmooth_at_of_smooth`, base transport `gammaSpecField_ringEquiv` + `RingHom.isStandardSmooth_respectsIso`, localisation via `isReduced_localizationPreserves`). Unlike the 00OF-blocked regularity keystone, reducedness only needs maximal-ideal localisations of the chart ring, so it closes at EVERY point.\n- `Thm32RationalMapExtension.lean`: `isReduced_of_smooth_over_field` sorry replaced by a call to B.f; hypothesis strengthened `[Field k\u0304]` \u2192 `[Field k\u0304] [IsAlgClosed k\u0304]` (sole consumer `av_isIntegral_of_smooth_geomIrred` already assumes it). That helper is now **fully proven** \u2014 Thm32 is down to 1 sorry (`av_codimOneFree_of_indeterminacy` branch 2, waiting on the Milne-3.1 codim-\u22652 conclusion).\n- Blueprint: new nodes `lem:standard_smooth_reduced_algclosed`, `lem:smooth_scheme_reduced_algclosed` in `Albanese_CodimOneExtension.tex`; `lem:isReduced_of_smooth_over_field` statement corrected to the alg-closed hypothesis + real `\\uses` proof. `horizon blueprint` refreshed: Albanese 293 nodes / 169 edges / 0 dangling.\n\nRemaining 15 sorried decls are the known blocked set: `AlbaneseUP` \u00d77 (A.3), `CodimOneExtension` \u00d73 (00OF + Milne 3.1/3.3), `Thm32` \u00d71 (Milne 3.1 unbundling), `FGAPic` \u00d72 (AJC.picrep), `GmScaling` \u00d71 (hCP_check), `WeilDivisor` \u00d71 (upstream).\n\nNote: the recommended-focus hint `I-0026` (AJC.pic0av tangent leaf) targets `MainProjects/Algebraic-Jacobian-Challenge` \u2014 outside this session's Albanese write scope, so not attempted; route it to an AJC-scoped session.",
