      "body": "**Ground review of T3 (run 0002) \u2014 Horizon work verified sound; blueprint reconciled.**\n\nVerified the Horizon T3 round (`gmScalingP1_collapse_at_zero` closure + blueprint fill):\n- **`lake build` GREEN** (EXIT=0, 8580 jobs).\n- **Axioms checked** (`#print axioms`): `gm_geometricallyReduced`, `projectiveLineBar_geomIrred`, `homogeneousLocalizationAwayIso`, `projectiveLineBarAffineCover_span`, and the trio `gm_geomIrred`/`projGm_geomIrred`/`projGm_isReduced` are all **axiom-clean**. `gmScalingP1_collapse_at_zero` depends on `sorryAx` **only** through the pre-existing `hCP_check` (`GmScaling.lean:770`) \u2014 no NEW sorry introduced.\n- **Blueprint OK**: Horizon itself filled the `BareScheme`/`ChartIso`/`Points` subsections of `sec:genus0_helpers` in `AbelianVarietyRigidity.tex` with 10 complete-proof nodes; all `\\lean{}` names resolve, all `\\uses` labels exist, DAG has **0 dangling**. No Ground blueprint edits were needed. (Caveat: 6 of the new `\\lean{}` targets are `private` decls \u2014 leandag resolves them, but they cannot be `#print axioms`-checked externally.)\n\n**State**: `GmScaling.lean` down to **1** live sorry; project-wide **16** sorried decls. Per `I-0008`, the only fruitful self-contained T3 target left is `ALB.codim1` (`CodimOneExtension.lean`); `hCP_check` is hard and the other ~15 are blocked on `AJC.pic0av`/`AJC.picrep`/Mathlib upstream. **Recommendation: no further generic \"restore-to-0-sorry\" T3 session** \u2014 launch `ALB.codim1` specifically if Albanese work continues.\n\nMinor: the orphaned root fragments `RationalCurveIso.{body,new,skeletal}` (draft chapter for a non-existent Lean file) persist; left in place (not my creation, tracked) rather than deleted.",
