      "body": "Session 0019: Pic0 tangent space \u2014 identity-section wiring landed (AJC.pic0av)\n\nPer the Ground recommendation, wired `overDualNumberAtEquivCotangentSpaceDual` to `Pic0Scheme C` at the identity section.\n\n- **New `Picard/TangentSpaceIdentitySection.lean`** (190 LOC, sorry-free): `stalkStructureHom_comp_stalkClosedPointTo` (a section retracts the structure hom), `bijective_algebraMap_residueField_of_section` (**a section's image is a k-rational point**), `overDualNumberSectionEquivCotangentSpaceDual`, `GroupScheme.identitySection`(+`_comp`), and capstone `GroupScheme.identityDualNumberEquivCotangentSpaceDual` \u2014 tangent space of any k-group scheme at the identity is `Dual \u03ba(e) (m_e/m_e\u00b2)`, no rationality hypothesis needed.\n- **`Pic0AbelianVariety.lean`**: new `Pic0.tangentSpaceCotangentDual` \u2014 given `Nonempty (GrpObj (Pic0Scheme C))`, an identity section `e` exists with dual-number points at `e` \u2243 cotangent dual. Proof is complete Lean; `#print axioms` shows `sorryAx` **only via the typed-sorry `Pic0Scheme` carrier** (all 6 general-layer decls are axiom-clean: propext/Classical.choice/Quot.sound).\n- Checks: `lake env lean` clean on both files; targeted `lake build` of both modules green (oleans built); root import added.\n- Blueprint: 7 new nodes in `Picard_Pic0AbelianVariety.tex` (`lem:tangent_section_retraction`, `lem:tangent_section_rational`, `cor:tangent_section_cotangent_dual`, `def:tangent_identity_section`, `lem:tangent_identity_section_comp`, `thm:tangent_identity_cotangent_dual`, `thm:pic0_tangent_cotangent_dual`), wired into `thm:pic0_tangent_space_iso`'s proof. DAG: 2054 nodes, 0 dangling, all 7 `proved=True`.\n- `thm:pic0_tangent_space_iso` residual: only the `H\u00b9(C,\ud835\udcaa_C)` identification, gated on `AJC.picrep` + the \u010cech/exponential-sequence route.\n- Also observed and logged on `I-0016`: the run-0003 T2 session died mid-build; AJC build dir now free; confirming full build still pending (