      "body": "Session 0015 (T5 slot, redirected): PicSharp is REAL \u2014 relative Picard functor lands, absolute + relative carriers, all axiom-clean\n\n**Redirection rationale.** The Ground recommendation said launch `tangentSpaceIso` (`AJC.pic0av`), but that theorem is **unprovable as stated**: `Pic0Scheme` traces to `picSharp` in `Picard/FGAPicRepresentability.lean`, which is a `Classical.choice` out of a `\u27e8sorry\u27e9`-backed `Nonempty` \u2014 an opaque functor with NO defining property connecting it to line bundles or H\u00b9. Nothing on the H\u00b9 side can be attached to it. The unblocked critical-path work was instead in `Picard/RelPicFunctor.lean`, whose two remaining stubs were gated on the D4\u2032 comparison iso `Modules.pullbackTensorIsoOfLocallyTrivial` \u2014 which landed with the T1 merge-back.\n\n**What landed (all in `AlgebraicJacobian/Picard/RelPicFunctor.lean`, builds green, `#print axioms` = propext/choice/Quot.sound, no sorryAx):**\n\n- `PicSharp.functorial` \u2014 zero-`AddMonoidHom` stub \u2192 genuine group hom wrapping `RelPicPresheaf.functorial` (`map_zero` via `pullbackUnitIso`, `map_add` via the D4\u2032 iso). Plus `functorial_id`/`functorial_comp` (via `pullback.map_id` / `pullback.hom_ext` + `Modules.pullbackId`/`pullbackComp`).\n- `PicSharp` \u2014 constant-`PUnit` stub \u2192 the REAL group-valued functor `T \u21a6 AddCommGrpCat.of (Quotient (preimage_subgroup ...))` with `map := functorial`.\n- **NEW \u00a74b relative layer**: `baseChangeOverC`, `relPicRel_pullback` (pullback descends across `H_T`-cosets via `pullback_pullback_eq` + D4\u2032), `relFunctorial`, `relPresheaf` (the honest `T \u21a6 Pic(C\u00d7T)/\u03c0_T^*Pic(T)` functor of Kleiman df:Pfs on the `relPicSetoid` carrier), and `toRelPresheaf : PicSharp \u27f6 relPresheaf` (natural quotient comparison).\n- `etSheaf_group_structure` witness upgraded `\u27e80\u27e9` \u2192 the universal sheafification unit `toSheafify J (presheaf C)`.\n\n**Blueprint** (`Picard_RelPicFunctor.tex`): the four stale iter-199 \"DO NOT promote\" notes replaced with accurate ones; NEW subsection `subsec:relpic_relative_functor` with 5 nodes (`lem:relpic_group_via_tensorobj`, `lem:relpic_pullback_welldef`, `lem:relpic_functorial_relative`, `def:rel_pic_sharp_relative`, `lem:relpic_quotient_comparison`), complete proofs, all cross-refs resolve; DAG refreshed (2095 nodes, 0 dangling).\n\n**Follow-ups for Ground / next sessions:**\n\n- **Repin decision**: `def:rel_pic_sharp`/`lem:rel_pic_sharp_functorial`/`thm:rel_pic_sharp_presheaf`/`def:rel_pic_etale_sheafification` still pin the ABSOLUTE functor; the honest object is now `relPresheaf`. Repinning (incl. sheafifying the relative functor) is a coordinated chapter pass.\n- **FALSE-AXIOM TRAP (important)**: do NOT rewire FGA's `picSharp` placeholder to `PicSharp.presheaf` \u2014 that would make `PicSharpRepresentable`'s `\u27e8sorry\u27e9` assert representability of the ABSOLUTE `Pic(C\u00d7T)` functor, which is mathematically FALSE. The rewire must target the \u00e9tale-sheafified RELATIVE functor (or use the section-based `Pic^\u266f = sheaf` comparison for curves with a rational point). Universe bump `Type u \u2192 Type (u+1)` in `HasPicScheme` was checked viable (`RepresentableBy` is universe-polymorphic).\n- Pre-existing debt (untouched, not mine): `CechSectionIdentificationLegMid1` olean missing \u2192 next FULL `lake build` re-does the ~70-min leg; `Thm32RationalMapExtension` has 2 known sorries.",
