          "at": "2026-07-02T00:39:44.743660+00:00",
          "body": "**Session 0015-horizon-T4 \u2014 diagnosis + 1 of 8 errors fixed.**\n\nFixed **error 1546** (`W_isMonoidal.whiskerLeft`): the v4.31 braiding-naturality form changed. Replaced `by simp [BraidedCategory.braiding_naturality_right]` with `by exact (BraidedCategory.braiding_naturality_right Z g).symm` \u2014 the exact fix the AJC copy already uses. Rebuild confirms 1546 gone, no regressions.\n\n**Remaining 7 errors (`lake build AlgebraicJacobian.Picard.SectionGradedRing`, ~1 min/build, deps cached):** `1664` (`rfl`), `1704` (term-mode `Category.assoc` type mismatch), `1888`/`1935`/`2640` (`rw` pattern-not-found), `3173`/`3840` (instance synth).\n\n**Single root cause identified:** v4.31 made `TopCat.Sheaf C X` a *semireducible `def`* (`:= Sheaf (Opens.grothendieckTopology X) C`, `deriving Category`) that no longer reduces under `instances` transparency. So every `X.ringCatSheaf.obj`-threaded goal in the monoidal-bridge lemmas becomes **ill-typed at `instances` transparency** (error note: `X.ringCatSheaf : TopCat.Sheaf RingCat` vs expected `ObjectProperty.FullSubcategory (Presheaf.IsSheaf \u2026)`). This blocks (a) the `dsimp only [whiskerLeftIso_hom, whiskerRightIso_hom, tensorIso_hom]` reductions (leaving `\u2297\u1d62`/`\u25c1\u1d62`/`\u25b7\u1d62` iso-forms un-reduced, so the follow-up `rw [\u2190 hwnat]` cannot match `F \u25c1 e.hom`), and (b) `rw` motive type-checking.\n\n**Ruled out (mechanical fixes insufficient \u2014 tested this session):**\n- `set_option backward.isDefEq.respectTransparency false in` on `tensorObjUnitIso_eq`/`tensorBraiding_eq`/`tensorObjWhiskerLeftIso_eq`/`tensorObjWhiskerRightIso_eq` \u2192 **no effect** (errors identical). Note `tensorObjAssoc_eta_factor_sheaf` (2640) *already* has this option and still fails.\n- `set_option maxSynthPendingDepth 8 in` on `tensorPowAdd_assoc`/`tensorPowAdd_comm` \u2192 **no effect** on 3173/3840.\n\n**3173/3840 are cascades, not roots:** `3840` is `typeclass instance problem is stuck: Category ?m` (an unresolved metavar), and `3173` fails to synth `MonoidalCategory (LocalizedMonoidal \u2026)` even though that same synthesis *succeeds* at the `monoidalCategory` def (line 1565). Both are downstream of the 5 sorry-typed bridge lemmas (`tensorObjIso`/`tensorObjAssoc`/`tensorPowAdd` args become entangled with metavars). **Fix the 5 bridge lemmas first \u2192 3173/3840 should resolve.**\n\n**Recommended next-session plan:** re-plumb `X.ringCatSheaf.obj` into the v4.31 sheaf API so goals are type-correct under `instances` transparency (the true migration). This needs interactive goal states \u2014 **LSP is dead on this full-`import Mathlib` file** (server crash), so iterate via `lake build <module>` reading printed goal state, or extract minimal reproductions into a small-import scratch file to regain LSP. The full goal states for all 7 errors are in the session log."
