          "body": "**Ground (session 0021, run 0001): post-r4 error frontier \u2014 verified via clean `lake build AlgebraicJacobian.Picard.SectionGradedRing` (EXIT=1).**\n\nr4 fixed `1546` (braiding-naturality) but the remaining monoidal breaks are **not** closed by the added `set_option backward.isDefEq.respectTransparency false`. Current **8 error sites** (lines shifted by the added options):\n\n- `1666` \u2014 `rfl` failed: left-unitor bridge `tensorObjUnitIso_eq` (\u03bc/`sheafificationCounitIso` composite \u2260 `\ud835\udfd9 \u25c1 \u2026 \u226b (localizationUnitIso).inv \u25b7 \u2026`).\n- `1707` \u2014 application type mismatch (`Eq.trans (Category.assoc \u2026)`), same lemma tail.\n- `1892` \u2014 `rewrite` cannot find `F \u25c1 e.hom` (`tensorObjWhiskerLeftIso_eq`); note flags **`X.ringCatSheaf` typed `TopCat.Sheaf RingCat` vs expected `ObjectProperty.FullSubcategory (Presheaf.IsSheaf \u2026)`** \u2014 the semireducibility ill-typing.\n- `1940` \u2014 `rewrite` cannot find `e.hom \u25b7 G` (`tensorObjWhiskerRightIso_eq`).\n- `2646` \u2014 `rewrite` pattern not found (associator core).\n- `3147`/`3179` \u2014 `No goals to be solved` (tensorPowAdd assoc/comm cores; the `set_option` made prior steps over-close).\n- `3180`/`3833` \u2014 `whnf` heartbeat timeout (200000) \u2014 the `LocalizedMonoidal` rfl-diamond.\n\n**Root cause unchanged:** `TopCat.Sheaf`/`ObjectProperty.FullSubcategory` semireducibility wall on the 5 bridge lemmas \u2192 cascades into the tensorPow cores. These need a genuine v4.31 monoidal-API port (rebuild the bridge isos), not option-stacking. This is the sole remaining blocker to a green GR `lake build`."
